bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_grid_fractional_fr_track_rejects_template_2026-11-27, 0, "normalized_grid_track_list (declarations.spl) reads the fr factor through normalized_grid_positive_int, which accepts whole numbers only, so 0.7fr returns '' for the whole list and the grid falls back to block layout. It hits the WM titlebar template auto auto minmax(96px, 0.7fr) minmax(140px, 1fr) auto (src/app/ui.web/html_css.spl:532, wm_quality_contract.spl:212)."
    web_grid_fractional_fr_track_rejects_template_2026-11-27, 1, "Repro: grid-template-columns:0.7fr 1fr, 200px; a blue full-width item in column 1. Chrome 159: k=1 40..121, k=4 160..488 (200 x 0.7 / 1.7 = 82.35px). Head and base 3543da84e51: k=1 40..239, k=4 160..959."
    web_grid_fractional_fr_track_rejects_template_2026-11-27, 2, "Minimal repro (body{margin:0}, .w{margin-left:40px;width:200px;height:30px;display:grid}, 400x300, blue runs on CSS row 10): <div class='w' style='grid-template-columns:0.7fr 1fr'><div style='height:20px;background:#00f'></div><div></div></div>"

